# This program is refused. After 6 months the
# rate is 6.61%, and the held payment of
# $2,147.67 no longer covers the interest on
# the balance left ($2,148.60 a payment). The
# trigger rate on that balance is 6.607%.
# Renew does not let a balance grow, and it
# does not guess which of the usual lender
# options would apply: raising the payment to
# at least the interest, converting to a fixed
# rate, asking for a lump sum, or letting the
# balance grow up to a cap. This file is not
# in the playground. Use a lower rate, or leave
# out payment held so the payment is worked
# out again.

mortgage "Crossed"
  balance $400,000
  rate 4.2% then 6.61% after 6 months payment held
  amortization 25 years
  term 3 years

show payoff of "Crossed"
